---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Contact MyRigFoundry | Get in Touch"
  description="Contact MyRigFoundry about PC troubleshooting guides, corrections, feedback, partnerships or other questions."
>
  <section class="info-page">
    <div class="info-container">
      <p class="eyebrow">CONTACT</p>

      <h1>Get in touch.</h1>

      <p class="info-lead">
        Have feedback about a guide, found something that should be corrected,
        or want to talk about MyRigFoundry? We'd like to hear from you.
      </p>

      <div class="info-content">
        <h2>General inquiries</h2>

        <p>
          For general questions, feedback or suggestions related to
          MyRigFoundry, you can contact us by email.
        </p>

        <div class="contact-card">
          <span class="contact-label">EMAIL</span>

          <a href="mailto:contact@myrigfoundry.com">
            contact@myrigfoundry.com
          </a>
        </div>

        <h2>Corrections and technical feedback</h2>

        <p>
          PC hardware, Windows features and manufacturer documentation can
          change over time. If you notice outdated information, a broken
          link, or something that could be explained more clearly, please
          let us know.
        </p>

        <p>
          When reporting an issue with an article, including the page title
          or URL will help us identify it faster.
        </p>

        <h2>Partnerships and business inquiries</h2>

        <p>
          For partnership, advertising or business-related inquiries, use
          the same contact email and include a clear description of what
          you are proposing.
        </p>

        <div class="article-note">
          <strong>Editorial independence</strong>

          Product recommendations and troubleshooting advice are not changed
          in exchange for payment, products or partnership opportunities.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>